      "id": "sol.amc-8-2024-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Only the ones digits matter. Modulo \\(10,\\) the expression is \\[ \\begin{gathered} 2-2-2-2-2-2=-8,\\\\ -8\\equiv2\\pmod{10}. \\end{gathered} \\] Therefore its ones digit is \\(2.\\)\n\nThus, B is the correct answer.",
